# The Gnome Priest spell quests, new in Forever: Confounding Flash at 10
# (94817) and Contingency Plan at 20 (94818), both from High Priestess Mims
# in Ironforge's Hall of Mysteries.
# Sources: quests.json and npcs.json for Mims and Confounding Flash;
# Forever's Priest class quest list
# (data/local/quest-audit/: 94817-94826 and
# 94818-94820 are new). The reference data has no giver for Contingency
# Plan 94818: Forever's quest data (quest 94818 and
# npc 258785, checked 2026-10-14) lists High Priestess Mims as its giver
# and the one who takes it, so the guide names her (npc 258785).
# Players' reports (quests 94821 and 94824, September 2026) note that
# the breadcrumbs' text says "head to Stormwind" while Mims is in
# Ironforge's Mystic Ward.
# alliance/dwarf-gnome/01-dun-morogh carries Confounding Flash on the route
# (94824, from Maxan Anvol in Kharanos) and alliance/04-redridge-mountains
# and 06-ashenvale carry Contingency Plan (94819, from High Priestess
# Laurena); this guide repeats them for anyone off the route.
# Not checked in game: written from the sources above.

step Confounding Flash
  tip At 10, go to High Priestess Mims in the Hall of Mysteries, in Ironforge's Mystic Ward. Maxan Anvol in Kharanos, Priestess Josetta in Goldshire and High Priestess Laurena in Stormwind send you to her with a quest of the same name (its text may say Stormwind: Mims is in Ironforge).
  level 10
  accept 94817                                -- High Priestess Mims
  turnin 94817                                -- High Priestess Mims: Confounding Flash

step Contingency Plan
  tip At 20, High Priestess Mims teaches Contingency Plan. High Priestess Laurena in Stormwind sends you to her with a quest of the same name.
  level 20
  accept 94818 npc 258785                     -- High Priestess Mims
  turnin 94818 npc 258785                     -- High Priestess Mims: Contingency Plan
